---
import BaseLayout from '../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import '../../styles/experiences.css';
---
<BaseLayout title="Experiences data-use notice — SEEN IN KOREA" description="How SEEN IN KOREA uses creator and business application data.">
  <main class="exp-page"><section class="exp-hero"><div class="wrap exp-hero-inner"><div class="exp-kicker">EXPERIENCES / INFORMATION</div><h1>Application data use.</h1><p>Personal information submitted for campaigns is used only to review applications and coordinate experiences.</p></div></section>
    <section><div class="article-wrap"><h2>English</h2><p><strong>Operator:</strong> SEEN IN KOREA (Won Global), South Korea. Contact: <a href="mailto:seeninkorea@gmail.com">seeninkorea@gmail.com</a>.</p>
      <p><strong>Information collected:</strong> creator name/handle, contact email, public social profile URL, follower range, visit area, languages, application notes; business name, category, location, benefit details and representative email.</p>
      <p><strong>Purpose:</strong> application review, partner vetting, potential campaign coordination, status handling and applicant communication. Contact emails and private application notes are not published to visitors.</p>
      <p><strong>Storage and deletion:</strong> records are held in the campaign operations database and must be deleted when no longer needed for these purposes, subject to applicable recordkeeping requirements. Deletion on request is handled manually by the administrator; no automatic retention-purge job is included in this initial version. Contact us to request access, correction, withdrawal, or deletion.</p>
      <p><strong>Eligibility:</strong> do not submit passport numbers, resident registration numbers, visa scans, or other sensitive identification. Eligibility to participate in sponsored activity may require separate lawful verification before selection.</p>
      <h2 lang="ko">한국어</h2><p lang="ko">운영자: 대한민국 Won Global / SEEN IN KOREA. 문의: <a href="mailto:seeninkorea@gmail.com">seeninkorea@gmail.com</a>.</p>
      <p lang="ko">수집 항목: 크리에이터 이름·연락 이메일·공개 SNS 주소·활동 지역·언어·신청 내용 및 사업자 매장명·업종·주소·제공 혜택·담당자 이메일 등.</p>
      <p lang="ko">목적: 제휴 신청 검토, 캠페인 승인·선정·운영 및 연락. 이메일과 비공개 신청 내용은 공개 페이지에 표시하지 않습니다.</p>
      <p lang="ko">보관·삭제: 운영 목적 종료 시 관련 법령상 보존 의무가 없는 정보는 삭제되어야 합니다. 현 초기 버전에서는 자동 파기 기능이 없어 관리자가 직접 삭제합니다. 열람·정정·철회·삭제는 이메일로 요청할 수 있습니다.</p>
      <p lang="ko">여권 번호·주민등록번호·비자 사본 등 민감한 신분자료를 본 신청 폼에 제출하지 마세요.</p>
      <a class="exp-link" href="/experiences">← Experiences</a>
    </div></section>
  </main>
</BaseLayout>
